This version introduces a Visual Zone Map right next to the dashboard. It dynamically updates as you add or edit items, mapping your list out into physical "tables" (Mains, Sides, Desserts, Drinks, and Supplies) so you can literally see where you have empty space or missing coverage before the party starts.

